 "sonicScene": {
  "category": "abstract",
  "thesis": "A night basin whose ground is a resonating plate: the music excites one designed bank of standing waves, and its nodal lines stand as ridges between sunken antinodes, carving rings, petals and cells that wander and re-form with the music.",
